    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="50">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 50</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="50" corresp="#wit-g-a">Gif hwa æwbryce gewyrce, gebete þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi>, be þam þe seo dæd sy:</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="50" corresp="#wit-a">Gif hwa æwbryce gewirce, gebete þæt, be þam þe seo dæde sy:</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="50" corresp="#wit-q">Si quis adulterium faciat, emendet, secundum quod (ipsum) factum sit:</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="50" corresp="#wit-b">Be æwbryce. Gif hwa æwbryce gewyrce, gebete þæt be ðam þe seo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Concerning adultery. If anyone commits adultery, he shall make amends according to the nature of the offence.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">(Vom Ehebruch. B) Wenn einer Ehebruch verübt, büsse er das je nachdem die Missethat ist:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">(Of adultery. B) If anyone commits adultery, let him make amends for it according to what the deed is:</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
